    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/f42b21e55476659df23d8f1f97681c01.avif?t=1748626142\" data-has-big width=800 height=181 /></span><br>Get ready for platforming incarceration insanity in this new Megadrive game, Prisonela MD. These levels may be short, but fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/14e4c20a3a8ed62fe003c2946b88372d.poster.avif?t=1748626142\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/14e4c20a3a8ed62fe003c2946b88372d.webm?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/14e4c20a3a8ed62fe003c2946b88372d.mp4?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special parkour abilities to overcome all the obstacles, and avoid all the traps. Don\u2019t expect to atone for your mistakes in this prison madhouse though. Each time you die, you\u2019ll be warped to a completely different level where you\u2019ll have to adapt and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/4c3c63f6fb81ed75f488159e46fb4c9d.poster.avif?t=1748626142\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/4c3c63f6fb81ed75f488159e46fb4c9d.webm?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/4c3c63f6fb81ed75f488159e46fb4c9d.mp4?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape this platforming prison hell? Find out in Prisonela MD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/ed322c11e919826b32e8d131550aa6a2.poster.avif?t=1748626142\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/ed322c11e919826b32e8d131550aa6a2.webm?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/ed322c11e919826b32e8d131550aa6a2.mp4?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes the ROM file you can burn and play on your original hardware if you have it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT shader option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random level order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platformer gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pixel art style</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/f42b21e55476659df23d8f1f97681c01.avif?t=1748626142\" data-has-big width=800 height=181 /></span><br>Get ready for platforming incarceration insanity in this new Megadrive game, Prisonela MD. These levels may be short, but fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/14e4c20a3a8ed62fe003c2946b88372d.poster.avif?t=1748626142\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/14e4c20a3a8ed62fe003c2946b88372d.webm?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/14e4c20a3a8ed62fe003c2946b88372d.mp4?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special parkour abilities to overcome all the obstacles, and avoid all the traps. Don\u2019t expect to atone for your mistakes in this prison madhouse though. Each time you die, you\u2019ll be warped to a completely different level where you\u2019ll have to adapt and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/4c3c63f6fb81ed75f488159e46fb4c9d.poster.avif?t=1748626142\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/4c3c63f6fb81ed75f488159e46fb4c9d.webm?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/4c3c63f6fb81ed75f488159e46fb4c9d.mp4?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape this platforming prison hell? Find out in Prisonela MD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/ed322c11e919826b32e8d131550aa6a2.poster.avif?t=1748626142\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/ed322c11e919826b32e8d131550aa6a2.webm?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/ed322c11e919826b32e8d131550aa6a2.mp4?t=1748626142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes the ROM file you can burn and play on your original hardware if you have it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT shader option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random level order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platformer gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pixel art style</p></li></ul>",
